<title>FRANCE: Pechiney sees full year loss.</title>
<headline>Pechiney sees full year loss.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pechiney chairman Jean-Pierre Rodier said the aluminium group would post a net loss for the full year 1996.</p>
<p>He told a news conference that provisions for the two billion francs &quot;Challenge&quot; restructuring programme would push the company into the red for the year.  </p>
<p>The Challenge programme seeks to find four billion francs in costs savings by the end of 1998.</p>
<p>Earlier Pechineysaid in a statement with its first half results that it expected lower earnings in 1996.</p>
</text>
